{"detail": {"templateUuid": "148aeff843914031b89f93880cb941ae", "projectUuid": "e8acd16ba70c458c91c46cde8c8f6dad", "name": "赠李白 听我心｜耳机创意短片", "description": "这是一个根据李白所作《赠汪伦》故事背景二创的韶音（Shokz）耳机国风产品短片。\n\n短片讲述了李白乘舟离开桃花潭时，江面狂风大作、波涛汹涌，巨大的环境噪音彻底掩盖了岸上知己汪伦送别的琴声，令李白倍感烦闷与遗憾。就在此时，李白在船舱内发现了汪伦提前留下的赠礼—— 一副韶音骨传导防水耳机。\n\n戴上耳机的瞬间，外界的喧嚣被推远，清晰、悠扬的琴声破浪而来。两人借由科技的桥梁，隔着风浪遥遥相望、心意相通。李白在琴音的共振中举壶痛饮，将离别的感伤化为豪迈的千尺深情。", "coverUrl": "/assets/ef397541f29caec8.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/72e56fb0d04f4fda82340018214d399b/4ac831a815df159d2f5bd69f659af870e654ac87.mp4", "snapshotId": 5429, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 2248820, "ownerUuid": "72e56fb0d04f4fda82340018214d399b", "avatar": "/assets/4b911d141caa2f21.webp", "nickname": "是YY呀", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 73, "tags": [{"id": 3021, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI影像狂飙季", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3024, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告单元", "parentTag": 3021, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/3024", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/69dfb342000000001a0318cd?xsec_token=AByyImegJS7B_D6PIyslKlNJ6TMx0dkh5zyR5HHzVCcNA=&xsec_source=pc_user", "createAt": "2026年04月16日 15:30", "updateAt": "2026年04月18日 00:31", "publishAt": "2026年04月16日 15:30", "honors": ["广告单元-入围"], "awardedTag": ["广告单元-入围"], "playCount": 34, "viewCreationProcessCount": 5, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 2, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/148aeff84391403